  "notes": "测速跟订阅走，智能选路不再用过期延迟。\n\n- 延迟测试使用订阅下发的 `http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204`，客户端不再把它改成别的地址。\n- 手动选择最快节点时，会先测量当前胜出节点，不用上次留下的延迟去固定线路。DIRECT、REJECT、GLOBAL、PASS、COMPATIBLE 仍然不能被选中。\n- 判断设备是否离线的直连检查仍使用 Cloudflare，避免国内网络访问不到 Google 时被误判为离线。\n",
  "notesEn": "Latency checks follow the subscription, and smart select no longer pins a stale delay.\n\n- Delay tests use the subscription probe `http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204`. The app no longer rewrites that address to a different host.\n- Choosing the fastest node measures the current winner before pinning it. DIRECT, REJECT, GLOBAL, PASS and COMPATIBLE still cannot be pinned.\n- The direct offline check stays on Cloudflare, so a healthy network that cannot reach Google is not shown as offline.\n",
  "sourceCommit": "b508cbf2b3cc90219e255cd576924c6913690851",
